{"words": [{"text": "وَلَكُمْ", "translation": "And for you"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِصَاصِ", "translation": "the legal retribution"}, {"text": "حَيَوٰةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) life"}, {"text": "يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى", "translation": "O men"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ", "translation": "(of) understanding"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "So that you may"}, {"text": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translation": "(become) righteous"}], "sahih": "And there is for you in legal retribution [saving of] life, O you [people] of understanding, that you may become righteous.1"}